{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>TeamQRCode 是一款專為需要快速製作 QR Code 的用家而設的工具，無論是個人名片、宣傳海報或產品包裝，都能在幾秒內生成專業級條碼。目前這款實用工具正在限時免費，原價 US $0.99，適合經常需要分享連結或展示資訊的用戶立即下載。</p>\n\n<h2>精選功能介紹</h2>\n<p>TeamQRCode 提供超過 48 種風格樣式，讓 QR Code 不再單調，同時支援即時掃描與相簿圖片掃描，方便讀取各種條碼內容。用家亦可以加入標誌疊加，打造個人化品牌形象，並將成品匯出為 PNG、SVG 或 PDF 格式，滿足不同場合的輸出需求。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-76-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-77-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-78-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-79-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-80-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-81-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TeamQRCode</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T12:59:36.835122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}